heartsim procedural anatomy pack

Geometry generated by heartsim-geometry::procedural::idealised_heart and procedural_torso from
published population-average dimensions (Lang et al. 2015 echocardiographic normal ranges; Kligfield
et al. 2007 electrode placement; Bayer 2012 / Streeter 1969 fibre rule; Cerqueira 2002 AHA segments).
No third-party mesh, texture or data file was used.

Licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0, the same terms as the heartsim source code.
